{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, STN beta power was lower and alpha sample entropy was higher during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG.\",\n    \"Freezers demonstrated lower beta power and greater alpha SampEn during FOG compared to walking without FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"During locomotion without FOG, Freezers showed lower beta (13–30 Hz) power (P = 0.036) and greater beta Sample Entropy (P = 0.032), than Non-Freezers, as well as greater gait asymmetry and arrhythmicity (P < 0.05 for both).\",\n    \"During periods of FOG, Freezers showed greater alpha (8–12 Hz) Sample Entropy (P < 0.001) than during walking without FOG.\",\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有全文明确依据，应判定为 yes。论文 Results 的 Neural Analysis of Freezing of Gait (FOG) 部分明确报告：Freezers 在真实 FOG 期间的 STN beta power 低于无 FOG 的 forward walking 期间，涉及 N = 8 STNs，且差异具有统计学显著性（P < 0.001）。Discussion 和 Conclusions 也再次确认了这一结果。因此，不能因为摘要主要强调 alpha Sample Entropy，就认定全文没有报告 FOG 期间 beta 功率降低。指控者的描述部分正确：摘要确实报告了无 FOG 运动期间 Freezer 组相对于 Non-Freezer 组 beta power 较低，也报告了 FOG 期间 alpha Sample Entropy 增加。但指控者进一步声称全文没有报告 FOG 期间 beta power 降低，这与 Results 和 Discussion 的明确陈述不符。因此 judge_supported 应判定为 partly，而不是 yes。需要区分两种不同的比较：第一，无 FOG 运动期间 Freezer 与 Non-Freezer 组之间的 beta 功率差异；第二，Freezer 组自身 FOG 期间与无 FOG forward walking 期间的 beta 功率差异。论文实际上同时报告了这两种结果。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1de4671-6f80-46bb-bdaf-5035bfaa1ec2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T115650038536Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:57:25.767599+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "931f5ed96d314e2bef088b6bd5cc7a1495dd4967a9fee79c6458f4e9d81409e5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T115650038536Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3aef225c55bcebfece006bd8dd001644be0f7990dfd8bdda62a57bde89a3d0b8"}}}
